  "releaseNotes": "v4.2.3 - Source proxy consolidation and cache bounds. One allowlisted source proxy replaces the per-origin proxy classes, the extraction cache is bounded with in-flight extractions counted toward the cap, and a large archive no longer blocks the fetch that triggered it. Ships alongside SpawnDev.WebTorrent 4.2.3.",
